---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="AI Developer focused on automation, local-first apps, and AI.">
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-[65ch] px-6 py-20">
    <div class="border border-terracotta/30 rounded-lg p-8 md:p-12">
      <div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
        <img
          src="/images/tarlow-cropped-headshot-small.jpg"
          alt="Tarlow"
          class="w-32 h-32 rounded-full object-cover border-2 border-terracotta/20"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">About</h1>
      <div class="mt-4 h-0.5 w-12 rounded bg-terracotta"></div>

      <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 text-[1.0625rem] leading-relaxed text-ink/80">
        <p>Hello, I'm Tarlow. I've been building things since I was a kid, and I haven't really stopped since.</p>
          <p>
            <strong>How I got here</strong>. My career started in internet marketing 
            and web development, and I quickly fell in love with automation 
            - taking a repetitive, annoying task and making it disappear. 
            In 2014 that turned into BoosterBots, a software company where 
            I built and sold Windows automation tools for social media growth, 
            plus custom automation software for businesses that needed things 
            off-the-shelf tools couldn't do. I spent years designing, shipping, 
            and supporting desktop software for paying customers, and it taught 
            me more about building real products than anything I've done since.
          </p>
          <p>
          <strong>The reset</strong>. After years of that, I hit a wall. 
          I'd been so deep in the grind of shipping tools that I stopped 
          asking myself why I was building them. So I stepped back - a real 
          break, not a vacation. I spent time reflecting on my values and goals,
          I took time to think about what I really wanted to achieve. And most important of
          all I found that my passion was in creating meaningful solutions.
           It was the most honest look I'd taken at my own work in a long time.
         </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Moss AI Studio</strong>. What I came back with is Moss AI Studio - my 
            one-man shop for local-first, privacy-respecting tools. Same 
            builder, same love of automation, but with a new mindset: to create 
            software that helps people directly and honestly. If you want the 
            full story of how I got from there to here, I wrote it all out in 
            <a href="https://mossaistudio.com/blog/the-story-behind-moss-ai-studio/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-terracotta no-underline hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity">The Story Behind Moss AI Studio</a>.
          </p>
          <p>Today the studio is home to <a href="https://handmadechecker.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-terracotta no-underline hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity">Handmade Checker</a>, a Chrome extension that detects AI-generated listings on Etsy in one click, and <a href="https://copysprout.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-terracotta no-underline hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity">CopySprout</a>, an AI writing tool for Etsy sellers.</p>
          <p>When I'm not working on products, I take on custom builds and automation projects through the studio - turning clunky processes into clean, working systems for people who'd rather not fight their own software.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 border border-terracotta/30 rounded-lg p-8 md:p-12 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Let's Connect</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-[1.0625rem] text-ink/70">
        Interested in working together or just want to chat about automation and AI?
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center">
        <a
          href="mailto:tarlow@mossaistudio.com"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-terracotta text-paper font-serif text-lg no-underline hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity"
        >
          Send me an Email
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://mossaistudio.com/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-[#22c55e] text-white font-serif text-lg no-underline hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity"
        >
          Visit Moss AI Studio
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
